        <m>900.0\%</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>100.0\%</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
    <solution><p>To change a decimal to a percentage, we move the decimal point to the right twice.</p>
<p><m>\displaystyle{ 0.09 = 9\% }</m></p>
<p><m>\displaystyle{ 0.9 = 90\% }</m></p>
<p><m>\displaystyle{ 9 = 900\% }</m></p>
<p><m>\displaystyle{ 1 = 100\% }</m></p>
</solution>
